1
00:00:00,536 --> 00:00:04,956
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)How the hell do I know who's the friend
and who's the acquaintance?

2
00:00:09,461 --> 00:00:13,211
(Sheldon:)That is a bracing cold.
An invigorating cold.

3
00:00:13,382 --> 00:00:16,172
(Sheldon:)Lord, is it cold.

4
00:00:17,511 --> 00:00:19,471
Help you with your bag, sir?

5
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:22,180
(Sheldon:)Thank you, fellow Bozite.

6
00:00:22,349 --> 00:00:24,889
(Sheldon:)And may I say,
you are the living embodiment...

7
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:29,480
(Sheldon:)...of all the promises made by
our lovely town's chamber of commerce.

8
00:00:33,485 --> 00:00:36,025
(Penny:)Wait.

9
00:00:36,196 --> 00:00:37,576
(Penny:)Wait.

10
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:40,320
(Sheldon:)Excuse me!

11
00:00:50,085 --> 00:00:54,005
(Sheldon:)One ticket to
Pasadena, California, please.

12
00:01:02,639 --> 00:01:05,059
(Howard:)Hey, look who's back.

13
00:01:05,225 --> 00:01:09,525
(Sheldon:)Interesting. The acquaintance is
the first to greet me.

